<!--
  白い熊 店 (shiroikuma-mise) fork: the languages this app offers, written once.
  SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later

  Japanese and English first, then the languages in which the app is translated to four fifths
  or more of upstream's strings (measured against values/strings.xml; re-measure after a sync).
  The system's per-app language screen reads this file, and so does the picker on the UI page
  (MiseLanguage.entries), so the two always offer the same list. The other translations stay in
  the package; they are only not offered.
-->
